# --- claude-optimizer ---
# State files contain a running log of work and decisions.
# By default we DO commit them — they're the point of the system, and they're
# valuable in PR review and team handoff.
#
# If your repo is public OR if you ever describe sensitive things to Claude
# (customer names, internal URLs, credentials in error messages), uncomment
# the lines below to keep state local to each developer's machine.
#
# .claude/state/PROGRESS.md
# .claude/state/MEMORY.md
# .claude/state/DECISIONS.md
# .claude/state/TASKS.md

# Always ignore the per-session counter — it's noise.
.claude/state/.edit_count

# Always ignore the archive folder — only the active ledger needs review.
.claude/state/archive/

# Per-developer local Claude Code permissions (machine-specific, not shared).
.claude/settings.local.json
